    pr_ref:  # 4d46
    description: "**Defect.** On event-publish edges, `meta.channel` duplicates `meta.topic` exactly — two keys carrying the same string.\n\n**Evidence.** The producer writes both channel and topic onto event_publishes edges, and the two values are identical on every such edge: channel != topic on 0 of 103 (identical 103/103).\n\n**Contract.** Two distinct metadata keys should carry distinct information; one of the redundant keys should be dropped.\n\n**Consequence.** A consumer reading message-publish metadata sees two keys that always agree, with no documented reason for both; a consumer that branches on a perceived difference between them will never see one and may assume the redundancy is meaningful."  # 4d46
    fields: {}  # 4d46
